TU or VOUS? Get this wrong and it gets awkward 😬🇫🇷

• tu = you (friends, family)
• vous = you (polite / several people)
• un inconnu = a stranger
• un ami = a friend
• je peux vous aider ? = can I help you?

🤔 Quiz: you meet your boss for the first time — tu or vous? Comment your answer 👇
💌 Save this so you never mix them up
👯 Send it to a friend who always says tu

Small steps. Big dreams ✨

